     A                                  1  2'ADD HELP -'
     A                                  3  2'THE "ADD" FUNCTION CREATES SEQUENC-
     A                                      ES. ONCE A SEQUENCE IS CREATED IT'
     A                                  3 70'ALWAYS'
     A                                  4  1'EXISTS. EVEN IF YOU DO NOT ADD ANY-
     A                                       LINES TO THE SEQUENCE OR DELETE'
     A                                  4 68'ALL THE '
     A                                  5  1'LINES OF A SEQUENCE , IT STILL EXI-
     A                                      STS'
