     A                                      HER SEQUENCE YOU NEED NOT TYPE IN'
     A                                  7 70'A SEQUENCE'
     A                                  8  1'NUMBER. YOU DO HAVE THE OPTION TO'
     A                                  8 35'CREATE ANY SEQUENCE YOU WANT AT AN-
     A                                      Y TIME. '
     A                                  9  1'WHEN A SEQUENCE IS CREATED  (FOR E-
     A                                      XAMPLE 500)  ALL SEQUENCES LESS THA-
     A                                      N THIS'
     A                                 10  1'SEQUENCE ARE CREATED. IN THIS CASE'
     A                                 10 36'THE SEQUENCES FROM 1 TO 500 ALL EX-
     A                                      IST NOW. A'
     A                                 11  1'SEQUENCE IS CONSIDERED TO EXIST EV-
     A                                      EN IF IT CONTAINS NO LINES.'
     A                                 13  2'WHEN ADDING LINES TO A SEQUENCE TH-
     A                                      E LINES ARE AUTOMATICALLY NUMBERED'
     A                                 13 71'BY TENS.'
     A                                 14  1'THIS LEAVES ROOM FOR INSERTIONS LA-
     A                                      TER. THERE IS NO MODIFICATION OF LI-
     A                                      NES THAT'
     A                                 15  1'YOU HAVE ALREADY ADDED. THIS MODE'
     A                                 15 35'IS STRICTLY FOR ADDING NEW LINES.'
     A                                 17  2'AS LONG AS YOU CONTINUE TO ADD 12'
     A                                 17 36'LINES AT A TIME , YOU WILL GET A N-
     A                                      EW BLANK'
     A                                 18  1'SCREEN FOR ADDITIONAL LINES. THE F-
     A                                      IRST BLANK LINE SIGNALS THAT YOU AR-
     A                                      E DONE'
     A                                 19  1'ADDING. AT THIS POINT THE PROGRAM'
     A                                 19 35'WILL RETURN TO THE MAIN MENU. WHEN'
     A                                 19 70'YOU ARE'
     A                                 20  1'ADDING LINES YOU MUST ALWAYS HIT T-
